!bin/**

# Media is listed file by file rather than as `!media/**` + an exclusion below
# it. vsce applies every `!` re-include AFTER the ignore patterns, whatever the
# order in this file, so a blanket `!media/**` cannot be narrowed afterwards —
# which is how 0.4.2 shipped 2MB of demo GIF in each of its nine platform
# packages. `npx vsce ls` is the check: it prints exactly what goes in.
#
# The demo recordings stay out on purpose. Nothing in the extension reads them;
# the README embeds them by relative path and vsce rewrites those to absolute
# GitHub URLs at package time, so the Marketplace page shows them without the
# bytes riding along.
!media/icon.png
!media/preview-view.js
!media/ipm-preview.css
!media/preview-light.svg
!media/preview-dark.svg
